# A .pubignore replaces .gitignore for publishing, so everything that must
# stay out of the archive has to be listed here, not just the extras.
#
# The build rules are anchored rather than a bare `build/`: the DevTools
# extension ships as a built web app under `extension/devtools/build`, and any
# `build/` rule reachable from here prunes that whole subtree from the
# archive — a negation does not bring it back.
/build/
/example/build/
.dart_tool/
.fvm/
.idea/
coverage/
pubspec.lock
*.iml
.DS_Store

# Points `modulith` at ../.. for work inside this repo, which would be a
# broken dependency for anyone installing from pub.dev.
pubspec_overrides.yaml
